  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5022a1df78513284c8a25fe6a22f4b85, type: 3}
  m_Name: TricksterFirstEncounter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueBase
  _speakerName: Trickster
  _spokenText:
  - What do my weary eyes spot! Ha! Another victim, eh...?
  - Well, well... From Faraway Country, are we?
  - I am from the Central Kingdom, Leader of the Spilled Wine Troupe... well of what
    remains of it... Ha Ha Ha
  - One of my quests was at Faraway Country, but can't say that we were swallowed
    there!
  - Wondering what swallowed means? It's a term that a ragtag group of people who
    were also "displaced" here came up with.
  - That makes you another "Swallowed One". Welcome to the Worlds Worst Club! Ha
    Ha Ha
  - But I know that probing look... Everyone new here with enough will has that look!
  - You want to know more? To struggle, escape or resign your fate?
  - Well I don't care why, but... The rest will cost you some leaf. I haven't smoked
    for quite a bit!
